  "description": "Migration compatibility surface for Excalibur.Dispatch. Provides a source-compatible IConsumer<T>/ConsumeContext<T> shape and a deterministic consumer-to-handler adapter so that simple message-consumer code written against the MassTransit API can be migrated onto Excalibur.Dispatch. A migration path (guide + feasible shims), not a transport/broker port. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the owner of the MassTransit trademark. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
